description:
Design a circuit that detects a falling edge on the PSW_1D input signal. The module captures the current and previous state of PSW_1D and generates a PSW_SIG output that indicates a transition from high to low (falling edge) when the signal changes from high to low, while also incorporating reset functionality through the RSTN input. The circuit employs a clock for timing and utilizes a registered approach to store the previous state, ensuring reliable edge detection.
