description:
Create a pipeline circuit that reverses the byte order of a 32-bit input vector over three stages. In each stage, the bytes are rearranged to progressively swap their positions, with the final output reflecting the complete reversal of the original byte order. The input is organized into four 8-bit segments, and through sequential processing, the output vector represents the reversed byte order of the input.
